==Battleground==
*5 [[Znache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**25 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**4 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Othom]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.

